OL,3,APhotos show widespread damage at US
OL,4,Asites from Iranian attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne member of the military, who was not
OL,7,Fnamed by CBS, said: "This is major
OL,8,Fdamage to our bases that hasn't been
OL,9,Fcommunicated to the American public.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
