OL,3,AEight children among 21 killed after
OL,4,Awar-damaged Gaza building collapses,
OL,5,Arescuers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 21 people have been killed,
OL,8,Fincluding eight children, after a
OL,9,Fwar-damaged building collapsed in the
OL,10,FGaza Strip overnight, rescuers and
OL,11,Fmedics say.
OL,13,FWitnesses told the BBC that the
OL,14,Fsix-storey building in Gaza City's Tal
OL,15,Fal-Hawa area had been left tilting
OL,16,Fdangerously to one side after an
OL,17,FIsraeli strike more than a year ago.
OL,18,FDisplaced families had lived inside
OL,19,Fbecause they were desperate, they said.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
